      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ひゃー！　やられちまったな……！\nあんた巨人なみに強かったぜ。\n負けたけど、生きてるって感じる闘いだった。\n約束通り、俺の技は教えてやるよ。またな！",
        "official_en": "Ah...you bested me. As strong as a giant, you are.\nStill, the fight truly made me feel alive, so I'll teach\nyou my technique. I hope to face you again!",
